28831,NIT_Download.pdf,10,16756," Page 1 of 10 INVITATION FOR EXPRESSION OF INTEREST (EOI) for Issue of Bottom Ash on Free of Cost, First come First Served Basis with Transportation by Bidder, from NTPC North Karanpura. Ref No. EOI No. XXXX Date: XX. XX. XXXX This expression of interest (EoI) consists of following Parts: - i. Part 1: General Information. ii. Part 2: Format for Submission of Response to EOI. iii. Part 3: Undertaking and Declaration by Bidder. iv. Part 4: Terms & Conditions and General Guidelines. N.B. All the above Parts (1 to 4) shall be duly filled in wherever required and signed by authorized representative of the bidder , on each page and shall be submitted along with the specified documents on or before the last date indicated elsewhere for deeming the request as acceptable. Page 2 of 10 Part 1: General Information General Details about NTPC North Karanpura: NTPC North Karanpura, located at Tandwa, Dist: Chatra having a total installed capacity of 1980 MW, is engaged in the business of generation and sale of bulk power. To utilize the Bottom ash in gainful and sustainable manner as per the provisions of extant MOEF&CC Gazette Notification and promote utilization of Bottom ash as resource material , NTPC North Karanpura intends to issue its Bottom Ash on free of cost and on first come first served basis, with transportation cost being borne by the Bidder. To facilitate this, NTPC North Karanpura invites Expressions of Interest for the above, for a period of Ten months, from its 2 X 660 MW",data/processed/extracted_items/ntpc_text/28831_NIT_Download.txt,
