28953,NIT_Download.pdf,6,10010," INVITATION FOR EXPRESSION OF INTEREST (EOI) Fresh Hiring of Transit Camp at Kota TERMS AND CONDITIONS FOR HIRING OF TRANSIT CAMP AT K O T A , R A J A S T H A N SPECIFICATIONS FOR SPACE FOR TRANSIT CAMP: 1. The property being offered should be situated preferably within appx. 5 Kilometer range from Kota Railway station. 2. The property being offered should have a space of 5-6 BHK (with attached toilets) and the built-up area requirement of approx. 4000 – 4500 Sq Ft. The property offered should preferably not exceed the first floor. In case the offered property comprises more than Ground plus One (G+1) floors, provision for a functional lift must be available. 3. In addition to the above, parking space for 3-4 vehicles should be available. 4. The lessor shall furnish the property offered at his own cost with the following furniture items/ electrical/electronic appliances: a. Geyser and Exhaust Fan in all washrooms with western toilet. b. All rooms to be equipped with ceiling fans, LED lights/tube lights and 01 fully automatic washing machine. c. 01 Kitchen with modular furniture, chimney, 01 microwave oven, 01 juicer mixer grinder, 01 RO system. d. All windows must be provided with new quality curtains along with curtain/blind fittings of good quality. e. The property should be equipped with an inverter power backup system capable of providing a minimum backup (lights & fans) of 3-4 hours for covering all bedrooms living rooms, Kitchen & dining area. 5. An NTPC representative ",data/processed/extracted_items/ntpc_text/28953_NIT_Download.txt,
