29011,NIT_Download.pdf,5,11207,"GEM Bid Number: GEM/2025/B/6667592 SECTION – I NTPC Tamilnadu Energy Company Limited Vallur Thermal Power Project NOTICE INVITING TENDER (NIT) (Domestic Competitive Bidding) 1. NTPC Tamilnadu Energy Company Limited (NTECL), a JV of NTPC Ltd. & TANGEDCO invites online bids for its 2 X 500 MW + 1 X 500 MW Thermal Power Project at Vellivoyal Chavadi Post, Ponneri Taluk, Thiruvallur Distt., Chennai, Tamilnadu from eligible bidders for the following package. Description of work Bid Security / EMD Contract Period SUPPLY, INSTALLATION AND COMMISSIONING OF NEW COOLING TOWERS FOR HVAC SYSTEM Rs. 1 Lakhs 09 (Nine) Months 2. BRIEF SCOPE OF WORK: The scope of the subje ct package envisages “SUPPLY, INSTALLATION AND COMMISSIONING OF NEW COOLING TOWERS FOR HVAC SYSTEM”. 3. QUALIFYING REQUIREMENTS (QR): The bidder who wishes to participate in the bidding shall meet the Qualifying Requirements stipulated here under: A The bidder in the preceding seven (07) years prior to the date of techno - commercial bid opening should have executed “Supply and Installation” of Cooling Tower of minimum 100 TR capacity for single tower with, i. Single (01) order, of executed value not less than ₹ 48 Lakhs (Rupees Forty Eight Lakhs). OR ii. Two (02) orders, each of executed value not less than ₹ 30 Lakhs (Rupees Thirty Lakhs). OR iii. Three (03) orders, each of executed value not less than ₹ 24 Lakhs (Rupees Twenty Four Lakhs) Note: Values indicated above are exclusive of taxes. B The average annual turnover",data/processed/extracted_items/ntpc_text/29011_NIT_Download.txt,
