29085,NIT_Download.pdf,3,4898,"Qualifying Requirement for Vendor Enlistment for supply of Zinc Sulphate Under 10MEG-37A A MEG Details 1. MEG No. 10MEG-37A 2. MEG DESCRIPTION Supply Cooling Water Treatment Chemical - Zinc Sulphate. 3. RESPONSIBILITY CENTRE CPG-1/ VDC 4. ENLISTMENT CATEGORY Category-I B TECHNICAL CRITERIA 1 The applicant should be a Micro / Small Enterprise (MSE), as pe r the latest definitions under MSE classification. 2 The applicant should be a manufacturer of “Zinc Sulphate”. 3 The applicant should have supplied “Zinc Sulphate” conforming t o the technical specifications of IS 1880:1977 (or its latest revision) to any Govt/ Semi‐ Govt/ PSU/ Power or Process sector companies in last five (5) years, from the da te of submission of application. C Documents to be submitted as proof of meeting the stipulated Qualifying Requirements: QR‐1: UDYAM Registration Certificate/ Valid NSIC Certificate QR‐2: IA) UDYAM registration certificate mentioning name of chemical Zinc Sulphate /Chemical NIC (5) code(s) and Activity as Manufacturing against the NIC Code. OR IB) Valid NSIC certificate / Factory License/ Consent to operate from Pollution Control Board/ any other valid document as proof of manufacturing with mention of the following items: Zinc Sulphate/ Zinc Based Salts/ Corrosion Inhibitors/ Cooling Water Chemicals/ Cooling Water Treatment Chemicals. AND II) An undertaking on the Company letter pad, duly sign ed/ stamped, of being a manufacturer of Zinc Sulphate , along with their Works addresses.",data/processed/extracted_items/ntpc_text/29085_NIT_Download.txt,
