29216,cor_29216_1_1.pdf,12,115877,"Sl No Document Section Reference Existing Clause Query / Clarification sought NTPC Reply (Read As / Clarification) 1 Section: General Platform Features Point #2, Page # 241 ZTNA / Secure Remote Access for Private application access in DC, DR & Cloud : Min. 8000 users with at least 100 App Segments. The ZTNA / Secure Remote Access solution must include a minimum of 05 pairs ( 05 + 05 in HA) of Connectors from Day 1. These 8000 Users are in addition to the above SSE users. One App segment can manage multiple applications. 10 segments can cator organizations with 100s of applications acceesible by up to 30K users. Therefore we recommend to modify the clause as below: ZTNA / Secure Remote Access for Private application access in DC, DR & Cloud : Min. 8000 users with 10 App segments scalable up to 100 App Segments. The ZTNA / Secure Remote Access solution must include a minimum of 05 pairs ( 05 + 05 in HA) of Connectors from Day 1. These 8000 Users are in addition to the above SSE users. REFER Corrigendum - 1 (Amendment) SL. No 1 2 Section: A- General Platform Features Point #7, Page # 241 The proposed solution must have CSA STAR, SOC 2, SOC2-type2/SOC3/CIS certifications. SOC 2 has versions like SOC2 type l and type 2. SOC2 type 2 is more comprehensive, detailed in comparison to type l. So, please do modifications as below for better security controls and clarifications to participants: The proposed solution must have CSA STAR, SOC 2/SOC2-type2/SOC3/CIS certifications. REFER Corr",data/processed/extracted_items/ntpc_text/29216_cor_29216_1_1.txt,
