29248,NIT_Download.pdf,9,16951,"Annexure- 6 Page 1 of 9 INVITATION FOR EXPRESSION OF INTEREST (EOI) FOR Issue of Pond Ash on Free of Cost, first come First Served Basis with Transportation by User, from NTPC Khargone Ref No. EOI No. NTPC/Khargone/AU/Pond Ash/Nov/2025 Date: 28.11.2025 This expression of interest (EoI) consists of following Parts: - i. Part 1: General Information. ii. Part 2: Format for Submission of Response to EOI. iii. Part 3: Undertaking and Declaration by User. iv. Part 4: Terms & Conditions and General Guidelines. N.B. All the above Parts (1 to 4) shall be duly filled in wherever required and signed by authorized representative of the user, on each page and shall be submitted along with the specified documents on or before the last date indicated elsewhere for deeming the request as acceptable. Annexure- 6 Page 2 of 9 Part 1: General Information General Details about NTPC Khargone: Both units of NTPC, Khargone have been put into operation after declaration of COD on 01.02.2020 & 04.04.2020, according to the installed capacity of NTPC, Khargone, Stage-I achieved 1320 MW with effect from 04.04.2020. Accordingly, around 4500-5000 MT of Ash is being generated on daily basis. The residual Ash after Utilization is being sent to Ash Dyke for Storage. Expected Pond Ash quantity for EOI is 3.85 LMT for next one year from Dec’2025 to Nov’2026. To utilize the Pond Ash in gainful and sustainable manner as per the provisions of extant MOEF & CC Gazette Notification and promote utilization of Pond As",data/processed/extracted_items/ntpc_text/29248_NIT_Download.txt,
29249,NIT_Download.pdf,5,12203,"(Page 1 of 448) NTPC LIMITED (A GOVERNMENT OF INDIA ENTERPRISE) SHARED SERVICES CENTRE – CMHQ-RANCHI CONTRACT & MATERIAL DEPTT. NO TICE INVITING TENDER (NIT) FOR PACKAGE: Deployment of one (01) Crawler/Chain-mounted Excavator (Minimum Bucket Capacity of 2 CuM) for a period of 12 months at Kerandari Coal Mining Project (Domestic Competitive Bidding) Mode of Tendering: Open Tender NIT NO.: - Refer GeM Bid No. - DATE : 27.11.2025 I. NTPC invites on-line bids on Single Stage Two Envelope Bidding basis (Envelope- I: Techno-commercial Bid & Envelope-II: Price Bid) from Eligible Bidders on Open tender basis for afore -mentioned package as per Scope of Work mentioned hereinafter. II. Brief Scope of Work: D eployment of the following equipment for 12 months, which can be extended up to 3 m onths at same rate/terms and condition and as per the requirement of NTPC Ltd: • Crawler/Chain-mounted Excavator (Minimum Bucket Capacity of 2 CuM) - 01 No The purchase /supply/transportation of fuel (diesel) shall be in bidder scope, NTPC will reimburse the cost of diesel extra @ 27.5 litres/hour of actual running of the equipment at prevailing market price (preferably the rates at nearby petrol pump from KDCMP) through documentary evidence for rate. D etailed Scope shall be as per Technical Specification / Terms of Reference. III. NTPC intends to finance the aforesaid Package through Own Resources. IV. Detailed Specification, Scope of Work and Terms and Conditions are given in the bidding document",data/processed/extracted_items/ntpc_text/29249_NIT_Download.txt,
