29393,cor_29393_1_1.pdf,13,32493,"Sl No Page No /Section /Tender clause Queries /Changes Remarks NTPC Response 1 Page 13/Annexure II/ AIO Technical Specification /A) Processor & Chipset-Intel Q870 / AMD B 650 Pls allow Intel B 860 Chipset also Intel B860 and Q870 both are commercial class chipset . We have technically qualifed Make In India product with intel B860 chipset only hence please allow intel B860 Chipset also.Further Intel Q and B chipset have main difference in terms of Out of band management which is Vpro .Vpro is not asked in your tender ,Moreover only one OEM has Make In India qualified product with intel Q 870 and which may restrict participation . No change . Tender Specifications shall prevail. Requirement is for Q series chipset which is for enterprise class segment 2 Page 14/Annexure II/ AIO Technical Specification /Secuirty -Others -BIOS should be from the OEM (i.e PC manufacturer) of the AIO PC Please ask OEM approved /Validiated BIOS As non of OEM manufacture of BIOS only they buy from vendor , validiate & customize as per their requirement .Which is only called OEM BIOS . Refer Amendment -I 3 Page 129/Special Purchase Conditions (SPC)/Point No 8 /Spllitting of Tender Qty -Non Splitable Please clairfy as MII and MSE purchase preference mentioned in bid Please clarify if splitting is not allowed the how Make In India and MSE purchase preferences should be given . As per clause 8.0 of SPC, the tender is ""Not Splitable"". Please refer SPC clause 12.0 & 13.0 read in conjunction with Annexure ",data/processed/extracted_items/ntpc_text/29393_cor_29393_1_1.txt,
