29417,NIT_Download.pdf,8,13994,"Special Instruction to the Vendors for AST-01 (Applicable to Present Application) Note 1: After finalization of present enlistment AST-01 cycle all Rate Contact of ash transportation shall be tendered through AST-01 enlistment and only those vendors who are enlisted in AST-01 will get a chance to participate. Note 2: ""All future Tender(s) for Rate Contracts (RCs) for Ash Transportation Packages in NTPC will be tendered amongst Eligible Enlisted Bidders of AST-01 after completion of this Enlistment process/ cycle. No further claim / request / representation will be entertained from the Parties / Vendors who chose not to participate in the present Enlistment Cycle of AST -01. Any such parties will only get opportunity to Apply for Enlistment in next Enlistment Process/ Cycle”. NTPC LTD SECTION-II QR & SOW ENLISTMENT OF VENDORS FOR TRANSPORTATION OF ASH THROUGH ROAD FROM NTPC PLANTS TO VARIOUS DESTINATIONS 1.) REF NO. WR-I SSC-C&M-0002-(CEG AST-01) 2.) NAME OF WORK TRANSPORTATION OF ASH THROUGH ROAD FROM NTPC PLANTS TO VARIOUS DESTINATIONS 3.) NAME OF PROJECT / STATION NTPC Plants 4.) BRIEF DESCRIPTION AND SCOPE OF WORK NTPC invites applications from eligible vendors for enlistment to be used for the future tenders of Transportation of ash through road from various NTPC plants to different destinations such as Road Projects, Flyover Embankments, Mines, Shoreline Protection Structures, Dam Construction, or any other destination as per the requirement of specific tenders having sc",data/processed/extracted_items/ntpc_text/29417_NIT_Download.txt,
