29486,NIT_Download.pdf,1,1549,"ABRIDGED INVITATION FOR BIDS (IFB) NTPC LIMITED (A Government of India Enterprise) CORPORATE CONTRACTS, NOIDA ABRIDGED INVITATION FOR BIDS (IFB) FOR GREAT NICOBAR ISLAND GAS ENGINE POWER PROJECT (108 MW ±5 MW) EPC PACKAGE LOCATED AT GREAT NICOBAR ISLAND, INDIA (INTERNATIONAL COMPETITIVE BIDDING) Bidding Document No.: CS-6401-001-2 Date: 17.02.2026 NTPC invites on-line bids for Great Nicobar Island Gas Engine Power Project (108 MW ±5 MW) EPC Package on Single Stage Two Envelope Basis (i.e., Envelope -I: Techno-Commercial Bid and Envelope -II: Price Bid) from eligible Bidders for the subject package. Bidding Document shall be on Sale from 18.03.2026*. Both Techno -Commercial Bids and Price Bids shall be received upto 1300 HRS (IST) on 10.04.2026 and Techno-Commercial Bids shall be opened on 10.04.2026 at 1600 hrs (IST) . The date and time for opening of Price Bids shall be intimated separately after opening of Techno- Commercial Bids. A complete set of Bidding Documents may be downloaded by any interested Bidder after Document sale start date from NTPC e -tender website https://eprocurentpc.nic.in or may contact Sr. Mgr. (CS) /AGM(CS), NTPC Limited, 6th Floor, Engineering Office Complex, A -8A, Sector -24, NOIDA, Distt. Gautam Buddha Nagar, (UP), India, Pin -201301 on Telephone No. 0091 -120-4946545 / 4946522 or on e-mail: priyanka@ntpc.co.in / bmandal@ntpc.co.in. * NTPC reserves the right to modify the above-mentioned dates. ",data/processed/extracted_items/ntpc_text/29486_NIT_Download.txt,
