29666,cor_29666_2_1.pdf,1,1778," EPC Package for Development of 900 MW (3 X 300 MW) Grid Connected Solar PV Project at Mandsaur, Madhya Pradesh BIDDING DOCUMENT NO.: NRE-CS-5816-004(EPC)-9 Corrigendum No. 2 to SECTION-I INVITATION FOR BIDS (IFB) Page 1 of 1 INVITATION FOR BIDS NTPC RENEWABLE ENERGY LIMITED (A WHOLLY OWNED SUBSIDIARY OF NTPC GREEN ENERGY LIMITED) CONTRACTS SERVICES Corrigendum No. 2 To Invitation for Bids (IFB) for EPC PACKAGE FOR DEVELOPMENT OF 900MW (3x300MW) GRID CONNECTED SOLAR PV PROJECTS AT MANDSAUR, MADHYA PRADESH (Domestic Competitive Bidding) IFB No.: NRE-CS-5816-004(EPC)-9 Date: 07.04.2026 Corrigendum No. 02 to IFB Date : 04.05.2026 ETS Portal Tender Search Code: NTPCREL-2026-TN000013 Bidding Document No: NRE-CS-5816-004(EPC)-9 1.0 NTPC Renewable Energy Limited (NTPC REL) hereby issues Corrigendum No. 2 to Invitation of Bids (IFB) dated 07.04.2026 and invites online bids from eligible bidders on Single Stage Two Envelope, viz. Envelope-I: Techno-Commercial Bid and Envelope-II: Price Bid, followed by Reverse Auction for EPC Package for Development of 900 MW (3 X 300 MW) Grid Connected Solar PV Projects at Mandsaur, Madhya Pradesh. 2.0 The tender event dates, appearing under Sl. No. 4.0 of IFB dated 07.04.2026, stands revised, as under: Corrigendum No. 2 to IFB 04.05.2026 Period of Downloading of Bidding Documents Upto 17:00 Hrs (IST) on 07.05.2026 Last Date and Time for receipt of bids comprising both Techno-Commercial Bid and Price Bid 22.05.2026 14:00 Hrs (IST) Date & Time of open",data/processed/extracted_items/ntpc_text/29666_cor_29666_2_1.txt,
29667,NIT_Download.pdf,3,5542,"Page 1 of 3 NTPC Limited CC-OS EOC, Noida Sub: Qualifying Requirement For Vendor Enlistment For ""Supply of GI Gratings/Grill"" (Startup vendors are also allowed in this group for enlistment) A) MEG DETAILS 1.0 MEG NO. 01MEG-06 2.0 MEG DESCRIPTION GI Gratings/Grill 3.0 RESPONSBLITY NCR B) Technical Criteria of QR (for applicants other than startups): (1)The applicant should be a manufacturer of Gratings or Grills having in house manufacturing facilities of Mild Steel Grating. (2)They should have facilities for galvanising OR should have tie up with other agencies for galvanising. (3)The applicant should have executed at least two orders for Mild Steel Galvanised Gratings during last five years from the date of submitting application Qualifying Requirement for startup applicants only: Applicant should be start up manufacturer of GI Gratings / GI Grills. C) Other Documents to be submitted (for applicants other than startups): In addition to the documents required in support of meeting technical requirements as stated above, following documents are required to be submitted by the applicants applying for enlistment:- 1. Three POs of the highest executed values of similar work during previous five years from the date of application. Copy of Invoice / Completion certificate from the concerned buyer/s in support of successful execution of supply against the POs to be submitted. 2. Audited balance sheet including Profit & Loss statement for the previous three completed financial years ",data/processed/extracted_items/ntpc_text/29667_NIT_Download.txt,
