29866,NIT_Download.pdf,12,20691,"Annexure- B Page 1 of 9 NTPC Limited (A Govt. of India enterprise) INVITATION FOR EXPRESSION OF INTEREST (EOI) for Lifting of Pond Ash on Free of Cost, First come First Served Basis from NTPC-Kahalgaon Super Thermal Power Plant – June’26 to May’27 EOI No. : 01 / KHSTPS / POND ASH / 2026 Date: 18.05.2026 NTPC-Kahalgaon invites Expression of Interest (EoI) from interested Ash Users for lifting of Pond Ash, for one year duration, on ‘free of cost’ , ‘ First come First Served ’ and ‘ as is where is ’ basis from NTPC-Kahalgaon Super Thermal Power Plant, Near Satkar Chowk, PO-Kahalgaon, Bhagalpur, Bihar-813214. Lifting and Transportation of the ash shall be the responsibility of the interested Ash User. Interested parties are requested to submit their re quirement(s) in the specified standard format to audkhstps@ntpc.co.in by 17:00 hrs. of 31.05.2026. ‘General Information’ and ‘ Standard format for application’ for Expression of Interest have been uploaded on www.ntpctender.ntpc.co.in. Registered Office: NTPC Bhawan, Scope Complex, 7, I nstitutional Area, Lodi Road, New Delhi - 110003. www.ntpc.co.in, CIN : L40101DL1975GOI007966 Leading the Power Sector How to Apply Annexure- B Page 2 of 9 INVITATION FOR EXPRESSION OF INTEREST (EOI) for Issue of Pond Ash on Free of Cost, First come First Served Basis with Transportation by Bidder, from NTPC Kahalgaon Ref No. EOI No. : 01 / KHSTPS / POND ASH / 2026 Dat e: 18.05.2026 This expression of interest (EOI) consists of following Parts: - i.",data/processed/extracted_items/ntpc_text/29866_NIT_Download.txt,
