29867,NIT_Download.pdf,9,16462," Page 1 of 9 Annexure- B (For Dry Fly Ash) INVITATION FOR EXPRESSION OF INTEREST (EOI) for Fly Ash supply to Micro and Small Enterprises (MSEs) /Local user engaged in ash-based products manufacturing, on concessional rates, ‘as is where is’ basis from NTPC MOUDA Super Thermal Power Station Ref No. EOI No. NTPC/MSEs/AU-01/FA /2026 Date: 18.05.2026 This expression of interest (EoI) consists of following Parts: - i. Part 1: General Information. ii. Part 2: Format for Submission of Response to EOI. iii. Part 3: Undertaking and Declaration by Bidder. iv. Part 4: Terms & Conditions and General Guidelines. N.B. All the above Parts (1 to 4) shall be duly filled in wherever required and signed by authorized representative of the bidder, on each page and shall be submitted along with the specified documents on or before the last date indicated elsewhere for deeming the request as acceptable. Page 2 of 9 Annexure- B Part 1: General Information General Details about NTPC Mouda: NTPC Mouda, located at Mouda District Nagpur Maharashtra having a total installed capacity of 2320 MW, is engaged in the business of generation and sale of bulk power. To utilize the fly ash in gainful and sustainable manner and promote utilization of fly ash as resource material, NTPC Mouda has reserved a certain percentage of issuable quantity of fly ash separately for supply to micro and small enterprises (MSEs) and local User at concessional rates. The supply of fly ash shall be made on “as is where is” basis,",data/processed/extracted_items/ntpc_text/29867_NIT_Download.txt,
