29869,NIT_Download.pdf,9,16155," Page 1 of 9 INVITATION FOR EXPRESSION OF INTEREST (EOI) for Issue of Pond ash on Free of Cost, First come First Served Basis (transportation cost to borne by the bidder) from NTPC Gadarwara Ref EOI No. NTPC Gadarwara/2025-26/AUD/EOI/01 Date: 15.07.2026 This expression of interest (EoI) consists of following Parts: - i. PART 1: General Information. ii. PART 2: Format for Submission of Response to EOI. iii. PART 3: Undertaking and Declaration by Bidder. iv. PART 4: Terms & Conditions and General Guidelines. N.B. All the above Parts (1 to 4) shall be duly filled in wherever required and signed by authorized representative of the bidder , on each page and shall be submitted along with the specified documents on or before the last date indicated elsewhere for deeming the request as acceptable. Page 2 of 9 Part 1: General Information GENERAL DETAILS ABOUT NTPC GADARWARA: NTPC Gadarwara (1600 MW), a leading power generating unit of the largest power utility of India, NTPC Ltd, is located in the Narsinghpur District of the state Madhya Pradesh. NTPC Gadarwara is at a distance of approximately 15 KM from Gadarwara Railway station and is well connected by road. NTPC Gadarwara, generates approximately 25-28 Lakh MT of Ash annually as a byproduct of power generation. NTPC Gadarwara has one ash dyke (3 lagoons) for storing ash in ponds. To utilize the pond ash in gainful and sustainable manner as per the provisions of extant MOEF&CC Gazette Notification and promote utilization of fly ash",data/processed/extracted_items/ntpc_text/29869_NIT_Download.txt,
