30036,cor_30036_1_1.pdf,36,53358,"Name of work: - Job Contract for Transportation of 4.0 Lac Cum of Pond Ash from the ash dyke of NTPC Vindhyachal to the Varanasi- Ranchi-Kolkata Highway project under NHAI Varanasi through RCR mode. S No Clause Bidder Query NTPC Reply 1 BoQ item No 30.30 The distance basis used for BOQ Item 30.30 (road transport, DDU siding to NHAI project site), and whether freight for haul distance beyond the ~17.30 km reflected in the estimate, up to the stated 50 km limit, will be paid separately. Distance considered in the estimate vs. actual project length BOQ Item 30.30 (Transport by road and unloading of ash at the project site/destination end) is described as falling within a distance band of ""0-50 Km"" from the DDU siding to the NHAI project site, with a single rate applicable across this entire band. The quantity given against this item, however, is 69,20,000 AU (1 AU = 1 Cum × 1 Km) against a total quantity of 4,00,000 Cum, which works out to an average haul distance of only about 17.30 km - whereas the contract duration is for a full year and the road project itself extends over approximately 35 km. As this is a Lumpsum tender, bidders quote a single overall price, against which the Purchase Order apportions value across BO0Q items using the rates and quantities set out in the tender; for Item 30.30 this apportionment is anchored to the ~17.30 km figure above. If, during execution, the road authority requires ash to be supplied at chainages up to 50 km from the DDU siding instead ",data/processed/extracted_items/ntpc_text/30036_cor_30036_1_1.txt,
