30175,NIT_Download.pdf,11,16829," Annexure- 6 Page 1 of 9 INVITATION FOR EXPRESSION OF INTEREST (EOI) FOR Issue of Pond Ash on Free of Cost, first come First Served Basis with Transportation by User, from NTPC Lara Ref No. EOI No. NTPC/Lara/AU/Pond Ash/2026 Date: 22.08.2026 This expression of interest (EoI) consists of following Parts: - i. Part 1: General Information. ii. Part 2: Format for Submission of Response to EOI. iii. Part 3: Undertaking and Declaration by User. iv. Part 4: Terms & Conditions and General Guidelines. N.B. All the above Parts (1 to 4) shall be duly filled in wherever required and signed by authorized representative of the user, on each page and shall be submitted along with the specified documents on or before the last date indicated elsewhere to deem the request as acceptable. Annexure- 6 Page 2 of 9 Part 1: General Information General Details about NTPC Lara: Both units of NTPC Lara (2X800 MW) have been put into operation after declaration of COD on 01.10.2019 & 07.11.2020. Accordingly, around 9000 MT of Ash is being generated on daily basis. The residual ash after utilization is being sent to Ash Dyke for Stor age. Pond Ash quantity for EOI is 40 LMT for next one year from Aug’2026 to Jul’2027. To utilize the Pond Ash in gainful and sustainable manner as per the provisions of extant MOEF & CC Gazette Notification and promote utilization of Pond Ash as resource material, NTPC Lara intends to issue some of its Pond Ash through EOI on free of cost and on first come first served basis,",data/processed/extracted_items/ntpc_text/30175_NIT_Download.txt,
