30206,NIT_Download.pdf,3,4778,"NTPC LTD CORPORATE OPERATION SERVICES, WR-II HQ, RAIPUR VENDOR ENLISTMENT FOR O&M WORKS PACKAGE ON PAN NTPC BASIS 1 CEG No. TMD- 20 2 Brief description of CEG Repair of BFP Main pump Cartridge for units up to 500 MW units at vendor works 3 Responsibility Centre CPC 4 Brief scope of work Indicative Brief Scope of Work: 1. This Brief Scope of Work is indicative only. The detailed Scope of Works shall be as mentioned in tender enquiry by respective sites. 2. A) Dismantling of BFP cartridge, cleaning, carrying out NDT of dismantling parts, shaft run-out checks, critical clearance measurement . B) Joint inspection after dismantling and finalization of scope of work with customer with identification of parts to be replaced. c) Repair and replacement of defective parts, NDT of parts as per approved quality plan, balancing of complete rotating assembly and assembly of cartridge with maintaining design clearance. D) Final inspection of BFP cartridge with customer as per QAP with measurement of float and other design clearance. E) Supply of spares will be in NTPC scope & all consumables will be in vendor scope. 3. The agency has to complete the job within specified period mentioned in tender enquiry. 4. Machines & T&Ps required for the above jobs as mentioned in tender enquiry are within scope of the contractor. 5. Ultrasound test kit, DP Test kit etc will be in the scope of the contractor. Test etc required will be carried out by the contractor. NTPC would only witness the tests. NTPC",data/processed/extracted_items/ntpc_text/30206_NIT_Download.txt,
